<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../public/styles/style.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Yanone+Kaffeesatz:wght@300;400;700&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    {{!--
    <link href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" rel="icon" /> --}}

    <title>Velocity Plotters | ELITE MODEL</title>
</head>

<body>
    <header>
        <img src="../public/assets/VELOCITY LOGO WITH TEXT - WHITE TRANSPARENT (1).png"
            alt="This is a image of the Velocity Plotters logo.">
        <h1>INTRODUCING OUR <span>NEWEST ADDITION TO THE COLLECTION</span> THE ELITE THREE HEAD</h1>
    </header>
    <main>
        <div class="wrap">

            <section class="display-card first">
                <img src="../public/assets/zoomed in Plotter 3 head.jpg"
                    alt="An upclose picture of a Three Head Plotter and LCD panel with white covers.">
                <h3>Velocity</h3>
                <p>The Three head plotter reaches <span>high printing speed, 65 - 75 Yards per hour</span> </p>
            </section>
            <section class="display-card second">
                <img src="../public/assets/wheel grip.jpg" alt="An upclose picture of a Three Head Plotter.">
                <h3>Power</h3>
                <p>The Elite model gives you the power to print <span>a long continuos job to the bar
                        or a
                        short job to the
                        floor</span></p>
            </section>
            <section class="display-card third">
                <img src="../public/assets/zoomed Out Plotter 3 head.jpg"
                    alt="An zoomed out picture of a Three Head Plotter with white covers.">
                <h3>Productivity</h3>
                <p> The Elite model prints continuosly to the bar which increases <span>Productivity 100%.</span></p>
            </section>
        </div>
        <h2 id="about-us-heading">About The Plotter</h2>
        <section id="about-us">
            <img src="../public/assets/angle view 3 head.jpg"
                alt="Three head plotter picture at an angle with white covers.">
            <p>The Velocity Elite Three Head is a high-speed inkjet plotter(printer). This production plotter can be
                used continuosly. It uses three HP45 Cartridges that last about ~6500 yards. When it comes to
                compatibilty it works perfectly with all major CAD Systems, file options are (.PLT, .HPG & .HPGL). </p>

        </section>
        <section id="industries">
            <h2>Plotter Application</h2>
            <p>This production plotter can be used in many different industries like:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Apparel Industry</li>
                <li>Automotive Industry</li>
                <li>Upholstery</li>
                <li>Sewn Industry</li>
                <li>Marine Industry</li>
                <li>Aerospace Industry</li>
                <li>PPE Industry</li>
                <li>Shoe Industry</li>
                <li>Industrial Industry</li>
                <li>Composite Industry</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="contact-us">
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p id="success-message" style="display: none;">Email has been sent!</p>
            <form action="send" method="POST">
                <label for="name">Name*:</label> <input type="text" name="name" id="name" placeholder="John Doe"
                    required>
                <br>
                <label for="email">Email:</label> <input type="email" name="email" id="email"
                    placeholder="email@email.com" required><br>
                <label for="contact-number">Contact Number:</label> <input type="tel" name="contactNumber"
                    id="contact-number" placeholder="(111) 123-4567"> <br>
                <label for="questions">Questions</label><textarea name="questions" id="questions" cols="30" rows="5"
                    placeholder="Any Questions feel free to let us Know!" required></textarea>
                <button type="submit" id="submit">Send</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.6.0/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="../public/js/form.js"></script>
</body>

</html>